<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Amsterdam Guide: 14 places – Jordaan, NDSM, Foodhallen, Rijksmuseum &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Jordaan &amp; canals in the morning</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>4.8811,52.37542,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. A'DAM Lookout</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · The swing costs extra (around €30). Go up before sunset. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>4.9021,52.38386,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Foodhallen</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come early to get a seat. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>4.8682,52.36695,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Rijksmuseum</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Book tickets online and plan two to three hours. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>4.88504,52.35984,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Anne Frank House</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Book weeks in advance. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>4.88408,52.37516,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Vondelpark</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Rent a bicycle. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>4.86412,52.3572,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Canal cruise</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Choose an evening cruise. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>4.88055,52.36353,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Cycling in Amsterdam</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Always lock your bike well. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>4.89687,52.37238,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. NDSM Wharf</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>4.89295,52.40037,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Oddities: cat boat &amp; monkey bar</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>4.89311,52.37813,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Begijnhof – quiet courtyard</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Be quiet – people live here. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>4.89004,52.36943,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. De Pijp &amp; Albert Cuyp Market</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Try fresh stroopwafels. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>4.89178,52.35523,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>13. Day trip: Zaanse Schans, Haarlem or Zandvoort</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Plan half a day. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/amsterdam/#o13</description><Point><coordinates>4.81798,52.47505,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
